Package: yunmai-noble-archive-keyring
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vanuan <vanuan@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/Vanuan/yunmai-noble
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: APT keyring and source for the Yunmai Noble repository
 Installs the archive signing key in /usr/share/keyrings and a deb822
 source list for https://vanuan.github.io/yunmai-noble/apt, so apt can
 verify and update Yunmai Noble packages without manual key setup.
